<title>BELGIUM: TABLE-BELGIAN FIRM INVESTMENT UP 41.4 PCT IN MAY.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BELGIAN FIRM INVESTMENT UP 41.4 PCT IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's National Statistics</p>
<p>Office released the following data on corporate investment,</p>
<p>calculated from VAT returns, for May -</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     May 1997   April 97  May 1996</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1985)  259.1	198.0     183.2</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	 41.4	 13.1</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Jan-May 1997	Jan-May 1996</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	 12.2		  5.4</p>
<p>NOTE - non-industrial investments rose 22.3 percent in the</p>
<p>first five months, industrial investments fell 1.6 percent.</p>
<p>    -- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
